at End of Year:</td><td>Promoted to the next class</td></tr><tr style=\"line-height: 2.2;\"><td style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Character and Conduct:</td><td>Good</td></tr><tr style=\"line-height: 2.2;\"><td style=\"font-weight: 600;\">Reason for Leaving:</td><td>Relocation of Parents</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"margin-top: 30px; font-size: 16px;\">We wish him/her all the best for their future endeavors.</p><div style=\"text-align: right; margin-top: 60px;\"><img src=\"{{student_photo_url}}\" style=\"height: 45px;\"><br><strong style=\"border-top: 1px solid #555; padding-top: 5px;\">Principal's Signature</strong></div></div></div>",
